</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1013)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Reopening an ended review brings back its link.</b> Reopen in the Review Manager (or opening your own old link) hosts the same review again and re-shares its clips under the link people already have &#8212; it no longer says the review has ended.</li>
<li><b>Import CDL&#8230;</b> in the grade panel and the Color menu: a .cdl, .cc or .ccc joins the look stack as its own layer, exact, in the same space as the grade's own CDL.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
